{"version":1,"content":"<p>新華社報道，中國工農紅軍長征勝利90周年到來之際，正在中國空間站執行任務的神舟二十三號航天員乘組，以在軌視頻形式向偉大長征致敬，告慰紅軍先輩「任務進展順利，祖國繁榮昌盛，我們不負重托」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T13:21:50.503301+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:25:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T19:57:38.996362+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T13:17:46.891123+00:00","content_hash":"b9660c14aeff6da2e56c60743cc5c010b3348c2084ad4bc952387806f0c9410e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}